      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPENCER (6) racing well without winning, placing at his last five runs. Last time finished 3rd in a Grade 1/2 on September 4 over 400m at Mandurah behind Elite Deluxe beaten 5.5 lengths (22.71). Expected to feature in the finish again. XENI BALE (1) settled close to the lead but collided in the run and turned spotting a start, finishing fourth (22.86) at Mandurah over 400m in a Other. Better than last start and can bounce back. ROSIE BROWNE (4) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (35.48) at this track behind Ramirez Monelli in a Grade 4/5. Has the pace to be prominent. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. Expected to be in the finish again. KING KUNA (2) comes here off a freshen-up and is worth consideration.",
